{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a043b23109f901d3ad8f952b2c1f333c6e34f59180eb21b959b20a658c6f3f68", "ja": "（アイドル達が出演した『クリスマスフェスタ』が\n無事終わった。歩達のステージも最高だったな……）", "zh": "（偶像们出演的《圣诞庆典》顺利结束了。步她们的舞台也棒极了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "db5d9e642e4acb1d1e2da43839e374cbb939aee9e481f66d8a0b13423d6b5055", "ja": "あー、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまー……。", "zh": "啊——{$P$}。\n辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1002_p", "source_sha256": "29cdefa31e77bd6ae6689ca70980f8ee6586296d8bea0cc50bb1497af44c1f31", "ja": "歩、お疲れ様……って、なんだか元気がないな？", "zh": "步，辛苦了……不过，你好像没什么精神啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1d16f9c139cc55343700d7e3ce604791ae8de8e489473af102b1446f7579f541", "ja": "うん……。ちょっとイベントの疲れがね。\n主にメンタル方面で……。", "zh": "嗯……就是有点活动后的疲惫。\n主要是精神方面的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a8fe45da8768c28bcec6da2b374461559661ab287bb3e46804a1b14a1bd4d702", "ja": "うう～。今、思い出すだけでも恥ずかしいよ……。\n『ローストビーフをセクシーに食べる』なんて。", "zh": "呜呜～。现在光是想起来都觉得好丢脸啊……。\n居然还要“性感地吃烤牛肉”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "00edb4fd89a7f266b76a64be5ffff4a93c70a2156aed539cd5922248d3b0ec5e", "ja": "隣にいたこのみさんも「見本をみせてあげるわ」って\nすっごいノリノリでさ……。", "zh": "在旁边的木实姐也说着“我来给你示范”，兴致高得不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7cf5abdb1549fbcf98afee139fd7f0dd02758eafa6b2beaf5abd9a16220050cd", "ja": "ああ、あれか……。\nこのみさんも悪気があったわけじゃないんだ。", "zh": "啊，是那件事啊……。\n木实也不是故意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6ca2c9e931bc41f2b283fd7c60aa3e45cacb0f0c0d10c8271dc0bd0399237663", "ja": "……わかってる。お客さんに楽しんでもらいたいって\n気持ちはアタシも同じ。だから頑張ったけど……。", "zh": "……我明白。想让客人们开心的心情，我也是一样的。所以我也努力了，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ae6c3ddb2515b3b278832a8821c58f277c77ac3a317be8d5efdb8b5e29a6e1a9", "ja": "やっぱり恥ずかしいよ～！　{$P$}、\nみんなの記憶を消したりとかできない？", "zh": "果然还是好害羞啊～！{$P$}，你能不能把大家的记忆都消除掉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1009_p", "source_sha256": "14b6be50332e2c7e3a7d06e35af4fd6e6d7e8ab0ce24a32cebb427b13860badd", "ja": "ごめん、魔法は使えないんだ。でも歩のおかげで、\nイベントは大成功だ！　頑張ってくれて、ありがとう。", "zh": "抱歉，我不会使用魔法。不过多亏了步，活动大获成功！谢谢你一直努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "422eac6b94c6b850b5f30431cee2006f2dcd5f73eef677845539babdd1985fe7", "ja": "そりゃ、ね……。だって、今日はクリスマスだよ？\nそんな特別な日に、アタシ達に会いに来てくれたんだ。", "zh": "那当然了……因为今天可是圣诞节啊？\n在这么特别的日子里，你还特地来见我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "626faf69b7d9b8cc7f64cbf0eb130dbcd680bf9c85cbf38f057f010c7c358477", "ja": "なら、アタシ達が、みんなにできることは……\n最高の思い出をプレゼントすることだって思ってさ。", "zh": "所以我就想，我们能为大家做的事……就是送给大家最棒的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b6cff46bdb77798b6b97f33388b46182c674e581b2643fbf27193a1d28bf17f6", "ja": "歩……。歩の気持ちは、ちゃんと伝わったと思うよ。\nイベントの間、お客さんはずっと笑顔だったからな。", "zh": "步……我觉得，步的心意确实传达给大家了。活动期间，观众一直都笑容满面呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4fd1d9e44c697b575a0b477ea8340416a27e8ef15a9d8d0f8e5c09d3cde9279d", "ja": "そっか……えへへっ。{$P$}が\nそう言うなら、アタシの頑張りも報われるかな。", "zh": "这样啊……嘿嘿。既然{$P$}都这么说了，那我的努力也算有回报了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0353_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "99935acbed7f80961137d132bd396ddf16d76476d37d7224649ecbc11399457d", "ja": "恥ずかしいこともあったけど……ライブは楽しかったし\nアタシにとっても、最高のクリスマスになったよ♪", "zh": "虽然也有过让人害羞的事……但演唱会很开心，对我来说也是最棒的圣诞节♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
